sses. Some, not all, refrigerants are controlled through regulations due to their significant impact on sustainability. When calculating scope 1 emissions, the type of refrigerant is a key factor in calculating fugitive gas emissions.","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"displayName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Refrigerant","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"examples":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Freon is a refrigerant","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"qualifiedName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"GlossaryTerm::Refrigerant","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"summary":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"One of a class of chemicals used in cooling processes.","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"usage":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Different refrigerant chemicals have different impact on the environment and sust carbon emissions.","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"versionIdentifier":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"6.3-SNAPSHOT","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"}