s purchased or otherwise brought into the organizational boundary of the company. Scope 2 emissions physically occur at the facility where electricity is generated. Most often sourced from utility bills - may also contain renewable energy credits.","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"displayName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Scope 2 inventory","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"qualifiedName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"GlossaryTerm::Scope 2 inventory","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"summary":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"A reporting organization’s direct GHG emissions. ","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"versionIdentifier":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"6.3-SNAPSHOT","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"}}},"status":"ACTIVE","type":{"class":"InstanceType","headerVersion":1,"typeDefCategory":"ENTITY_DEF","typeDefGUID":"0db3e6ec-f5ef-4d75-ae38-b7ee6fd6ec0a","typeDefName":"GlossaryTerm","typeDefVersion":1},"updateTime":1639984840038,"updatedBy":"Egeria Project","version":1791274688680},{"class":"EntityDetail","classifications":[{"class":"Classification","classificationOrigin":"ASSIGNED","createTime":1639984840038,"createdBy":"Egeria Project","headerVersion":1,"instanceProvenanceType":"CONTENT_PACK","maintainedBy":["Egeria Project"],"metadataCollectionId":"655b1965-4c29-4a0e-8a5d-3f55a37b3799","metadataCollectionName":"Coco Pharmaceuticals Combination","name":"Anchors","properties":{"class":"InstanceProperties","headerVersion":1,"instanceProperties":{"anchorDomainName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"AuthoredReferenceable","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"anchorScopeGUIDs":{"class":"ArrayPropertyValue","arrayCount":1,"arrayValues":{"class":"InstanceProperties","headerVersion":1,"instanceProperties":{"0":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"2f48981a-d752-4b96-b67f-d0206b2a7681","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"}}},"headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"ARRAY","typeGUID":"0428b5d3-f824-459c-b7f5-f8151de59707","typeName":"array<string>"},"anchorTypeName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"GlossaryTerm","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"}}},"status":"ACTIVE","type":{"class":"InstanceType","headerVersion":1,"typeDefCategory":"CLASSIFICATION_DEF","typeDefGUID":"aa44f302-2e43-4669-a1e7-edaae414fc6e","typeDefName":"Anchors","typeDefVersion":1},"updateTime":1639984840038,"updatedBy":"Egeria Project","version":1791274688680}],"createTime":1639984840038,"createdBy":"Egeria Project","guid":"ed8af755-24d8-40cd-b903-a277d65da255","headerVersion":1,"instanceProvenanceType":"CONTENT_PACK","maintainedBy":["Egeria Project"],"metadataCollectionId":"655b1965-4c29-4a0e-8a5d-3f55a37b3799","metadataCollectionName":"Coco Pharmaceuticals Combination","properties":{"class":"InstanceProperties","headerVersion":1,"instanceProperties":{"abbreviation":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"scope 3","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"description":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"All other indirect GHG emissions (not included in Scope 2) that occur in the value chain of the reporting company. Scope 3 can be broken down into upstream emissions that occur in the supply chain (for example, from production or extraction of purchased materials) and downstream emissions that occur as a consequence of using the organization’s products or services. \nTries to capture the complex web of emissions from supply chains and indirect partners, consumers, producers. Scope 3 is an optional reporting category that allows for the treatment of all other indirect emissions. Scope 3 emissions are a consequence of the activities of the company, but occur from sources not owned or controlled by the company. Some examples of scope 3 activities are extraction and production of purchased materials; transportation of purchased fuels; and use of sold products and services.","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"displayName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Scope 3 Emissions","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"examples":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Goods & transportation emissions","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"qualifiedName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"GlossaryTerm::Scope 3 Emissions","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"summary":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Indirect emissions from upstream or downstream partners/suppliers/consumers","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"usage":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"Our scope 3 inventory includes employee commuting emissions.","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"},"versionIdentifier":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"6.3-SNAPSHOT","typeGUID":"b34a64b9-554a-42b1-8f8a-7d5c2339f9c4","typeName":"string"}}},"status":"ACTIVE","type":{"class":"InstanceType","headerVersion":1,"typeDefCategory":"ENTITY_DEF","typeDefGUID":"0db3e6ec-f5ef-4d75-ae38-b7ee6fd6ec0a","typeDefName":"GlossaryTerm","typeDefVersion":1},"updateTime":1639984840038,"updatedBy":"Egeria Project","version":1791274688680},{"class":"EntityDetail","classifications":[{"class":"Classification","classificationOrigin":"ASSIGNED","createTime":1639984840038,"createdBy":"Egeria Project","headerVersion":1,"instanceProvenanceType":"CONTENT_PACK","maintainedBy":["Egeria Project"],"metadataCollectionId":"655b1965-4c29-4a0e-8a5d-3f55a37b3799","metadataCollectionName":"Coco Pharmaceuticals Combination","name":"Anchors","properties":{"class":"InstanceProperties","headerVersion":1,"instanceProperties":{"anchorDomainName":{"class":"PrimitivePropertyValue","headerVersion":1,"instancePropertyCategory":"PRIMITIVE","primitiveDefCategory":"OM_PRIMITIVE_TYPE_STRING","primitiveValue":"AuthoredReferenceable","typeGUID":"b34a64b